=== WEB SOURCE ANALYSIS ===
LiveSignalMonitorPage.tsx is a thin wrapper over `useSelectedVehicle` +
`useLiveSignalStream` feeding the shared `LiveSignalTail` component:
  - PageContainer: title (liveMonitor.title), subtitle (liveMonitor.subtitle)
  - actions: <VehicleSelect /> + connection Badge (liveMonitor.connected /
    liveMonitor.disconnected)
  - body: <LiveSignalTail> — filter, pause/resume, auto-scroll, clear; four stat
    tiles (Signals/sec, Buffer Size, Unique Signals, Filtered); scrolling table
    (Time · Signal · Value · Type · Freshness); "Waiting for signals…" empty.
Data sources (manifest): "renders from navigation values / local state" — the live
SSE tail is implemented as the de-facto live source with all four data states.
Charts: 0 (manifest) · Maps: 0 (manifest).
