Reuse (DRY — web reuses the same LiveSignalTail across /signals + /live-monitor):
  WorkspacePanel / WorkspaceStatCard / WorkspaceState{Loading,Empty,Error} and the value types
  LiveTailEntry / WorkspaceDataPhase / WorkspaceSignalValue / WorkspaceVehicle are reused from the
  sibling SignalsWorkspace feature. Injection protocols are internal; the public model API surface is
  a parameterless `init()` (so the shared internal value types are never exposed publicly).

Model isolation: @MainActor @Observable. The live SSE source surfaces an explicit WorkspaceDataPhase so
loading / empty / error / success render for the tail. Live values older than 2 minutes are flagged stale
per ADR-013 (per-row Freshness indicator + model.isLiveStale). Units format at the display boundary;
nothing non-SI is stored or computed. Type names are namespaced (LiveSignalMonitor* / LMText) to avoid
module-wide symbol collisions.

